          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Peace of mind,</span><span class=\"futura-bold\"> <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">built in</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Trusted therapy:</span> NPseal delivers proven NPWT in a simple design for both surgeons and patients to use.<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Designed for dependability:</span> NPseal is engineered to provide dependable wound protection and healing support.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Less worry, more focus:</span> No more concerns about battery life or canister issues. NPseal helps you focus on your patients, not the device.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Confidence at discharge:</span> NPseal’s self-managed design helps ensure patients stay on track at home, giving you confidence long after they leave your care.</p>\n",
